{
  "tema": 7509,
  "slug": "unos-cuantos",
  "titulo": "Using unos cuantos / unas cuantas + noun for a few",
  "subtitulo": "Unos cuantos amigos, unas cuantas llamadas: a few, always plural.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Unos cuantos / unas cuantas + plural noun = a few. Always plural, and it agrees in gender with the noun.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _a few_, use **unos cuantos** or **unas cuantas**. It's always **plural**, because it always means more than one, and it works with things or people."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**unos cuantos / unas cuantas**",
            "plural noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It **agrees** in gender with the noun: **unos cuantos amigos**, **unas cuantas llamadas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It sounds more positive than **pocos** (_few, not many_): **unos cuantos** = _a handful, some_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **unos cuantos** is a handful you can count on one hand, and they all wear the same gender."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Vi a Beto con ==unos cuantos== amigos en el parque.",
              "en": "I saw Beto with a few friends in the park."
            },
            {
              "es": "Voy a salir tarde: tengo que hacer ==unas cuantas== llamadas.",
              "en": "I'm leaving late: I have to make a few calls."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ahorró ==unos cuantos== pesos para el sábado.",
              "en": "He saved a few pesos for Saturday."
            },
            {
              "es": "Había ==unas cuantas== personas esperando el camión.",
              "en": "There were a few people waiting for the bus."
            },
            {
              "es": "Agarré ==unas cuantas== olas buenas.",
              "en": "I caught a few good waves."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
